2.
Definitions.
- In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means a legislation enacted by the Legislature;
(b)
"Government" means the Government of Goa, Daman and Diu;
(c)
"Legislature" means the Legislative Assembly of Goa, Daman and Diu;
(d)
"Official Gazette" means the Official Gazette of Goa, Daman and Diu;
(e)
"Union territory" means the Union territory of Goa, Daman and Diu.
